=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=51W9LDa7WO8Q7kNvwFs_tw-&_nc_oc=AdolYX8y-nOO1d1bGJSmf5vR0lUslMQBqAOKrVBwe_GMKyCBFMgkFkQkrWuCVEwCThI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4B148mnJ-30j3gv6fYCxFCJth4AbMl2En1XqZNWdOTLg&oe=6A070F22"}, {"file_name": "PlayerDamage01_2560x1440.png", "id": "1147109633473090", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391930_1147109636806423_6909828639526574047_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KwjjFcxD9SwQ7kNvwFuR_eu&_nc_oc=AdqC2QOOuR7AQW-VVjSbfBhLNpTpDTF7OknlymCzNSbh59OgismMaRgoGYbLZP24Qi8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GQoCwkI10lpLpuMzyAbVbm7_7FizdR8qRvk1nNIAV1A&oe=6A07252D"}, {"file_name": "Sniper01_2560x1440.png", "id": "619526613778310", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391913_619526617111643_4779182521656177024_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8HXOatJ6OkwQ7kNvwGdW5KT&_nc_oc=Adp0UMWK5Dz5LR3YMqx3DRdNAfM9ohlkQebb7Dl9gOroZ5xk4YWvI2VsoEbt-i1K13A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4HPu5-Jv0wmNWHyG3OeTtYDVFZvZi8rlOkMsy1j9B-xQ&oe=6A073744"}, {"file_name": "DualWield02_2560x1440.png", "id": "2846696975512873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391971_2846696978846206_3152004226380843791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Rl_cwGfiHAQ7kNvwHrABsT&_nc_oc=AdoKOPMjZPlXfZEeDokjoRTC41SuFk9F__h9nWDTcRX1XvgSLcCJilUmSRToHlTTZok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7YjldP_l0yUn7RH4vwR2cROAx1hXjpGsooVTnQ5faR6Q&oe=6A074219"}, {"file_name": "LOH-Planet_2560x1440.png", "id": "1027032369454852", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391913_1027032372788185_6272348873203520910_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OpfZHXFLM-oQ7kNvwEL2rR_&_nc_oc=Ado96ta_L1ygVXn03hFJvSGN4YDcDzObPc9Fmxfww-AgBLj4BMHnKHncFRtFwH-Svk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4vD8F282eaeaSYL6uCWKWMdKW7Jt0P6uqOa1hOgQH3qA&oe=6A071C6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hack The System", "keywords": ["scifi", "shooter", "spy", "agent", "narrative"], "long_description": "# HACK THE SYSTEM\n**A Sci-Fi Wave Shooter**\n\nThe Constitutional Federal Technocracy maintains an illusion of total efficiency, pragmatism and control. The Agency knows better. Operating from the shadows, they ensure order in a world that secretly teeters on the brink of chaos.\n\nFor over 200 years, the CFT has been free of all deadly disease. Now, a new plague called Tracosis has claimed the lives of millions across the Central Systems. \n\nYour objective is simple: eliminate threats, secure classified data, and maintain control. But as your missions unfold, troubling secrets begin to surface...\n\n**Key Features**\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Wave-Shooter\n\nEach level will bring waves of enemies as you attempt to secure various locations. Use cover, movement, and precision shooting to survive escalating encounters.\n\n{1344938703584295}\n\n\ud83c\udf06 7 Locations\n\nBattle across diverse environments, from neon-lit cityscapes and corporate skyscrapers to underground bio-labs.\n\n{965507812213056}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b 5 Advanced Weapons\n\nEquip yourself with a deadly arsenal of weaponry.\n\n{1284872422779690}\n\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f A Dark Sci-Fi Story\n\nUnravel a subtle narrative of power, control, and rebellion.\n\n{460015863845390}", "short_description": "Step into the role of an elite Operative working for The Agency, a shadowy government organization that thrives on secrecy and precision. Armed with cutting-edge weaponry, you will neutralize threats and maintain order\u2014at any cost."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.corestrand.net/hack-the-system-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Core Strand LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https:/